      "source": [
        "# Importer\n",
        "\n",
        "An importer is an object involved in locating and loading a module. In Python's import system, finders locate modules and loaders execute them.\n",
        "\n",
        "Source: [Python glossary](https://docs.python.org/3/glossary.html#term-importer)"
      ]
    }
